@startuml
title Video Suggestion System UML State Machine Diagram

state StartChoice <<choice>>
state UserChoice <<choice>>
state GatherVideos <<choice>>
state AddDetails <<choice>>
state SendSuggestions <<choice>>

[*] --> UserChoice

UserChoice --> IdentifyUser
UserChoice --> RequestVideo

state IdentifyUser
IdentifyUser : entry / system identifies user
IdentifyUser : do / uses user's profile or preferences, trending videos from the user’s area, videos with similar tags, videos from similar genres, and promoted videos
IdentifyUser : exit / user identified

state RequestVideo
RequestVideo : entry / user requests video
RequestVideo : do / system gathers different types of videos
RequestVideo : exit / request received

state GatherVideos
GatherVideos : entry / system gathers videos
GatherVideos : do / adds additional details such as thumbnails and view counts to the suggested videos
GatherVideos : exit / videos gathered with details added

state AddDetails
AddDetails : entry / system adds details to videos
AddDetails : do / sends the suggested videos to the user
AddDetails : exit / videos sent to user

state SendSuggestions
SendSuggestions : entry / system sends suggestions to user
SendSuggestions : do / ends process after sending suggestions
SendSuggestions : exit / suggestions sent
@enduml
